Z||000008||c m west||03-03-2001||05:05 PM||||check this sight out - <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000009||c m west||03-05-2001||12:46 PM||||evrything from the 2.8 will bolt up to the 3.4 motor from a Camaro, just remeber to retain the 3.4 fuel injectors, and drill the block to atach the starter to the other side ( not a big issue here when you perform these swaps nearly 3 times a month )<P>  We have a fixture for drilling nd tapping the block if you are intersted, or, if you would rather have us perform the swap, check out our website at <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A>  - 310-305-4111<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero||||reg||1
Z||000010||loafer87gt||03-05-2001||01:45 PM||||The $1200 does indeed sound like way too much $. My Gm dealership in town said they could get me a brand new GM Performance Crate 3.4 for a little over $2200 Canadian ($1400 US) with warranty. Look around, you can find a better deal..||||reg||1
Z||000011||MontanaFiero||03-05-2001||02:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by loafer87gt:<BR><B>The $1200 does indeed sound like way too much $. My Gm dealership in town said they could get me a brand new GM Performance Crate 3.4 for a little over $2200 Canadian ($1400 US) with warranty. Look around, you can find a better deal..</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Funny... my GM dealer told me $3400!--so did Carquest.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> ( I can go Checker (Kragen-Schucks) for $1599)  The cool part is I can go to any other city and get the damned thing for a couple hundred less  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  What sucks is it costs several hundred just to get it here!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> Just a bit frustrating, if you ask me!||||reg||1
Z||000012||mshill||03-05-2001||03:03 PM||||Your GM dealer will not get you that engine for $1400 because he is going to want a core or $500 bucks more.  Plus you will still need all the trimmings including fuel rail and injectors.||||reg||1
